说与姚际恒，释“無吪”为不言，“罦”为覆车之网，“造”为为也，“覺”为寤也，“庸”为用也。","fullText":"方玉润集释依次训“爰爰”“雉”“離”“羅”“罹”“吪”“罦”“造”“覺”“庸”：以“爰爰”为兔之缓行，“雉”性耿介，“離”为丽着，“羅”为网，“罹”为忧；又据旧说与姚际恒，释“無吪”为不言，“罦”为覆车之网，“造”为为也，“覺”为寤也，“庸”为用也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":["seg-001:3-4:爰爰","seg-002:1-1:雉","seg-002:2-2:離","seg-002:4-4:羅","seg-006:4-4:罹","seg-007:3-4:無吪","seg-009:4-4:罦","seg-011:3-3:造","seg-014:4-4:覺","seg-018:3-3:庸"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-1-1","anchor-1-2","anchor-1-3","anchor-1-4","anchor-1-5","anchor-1-6","anchor-1-7","anchor-1-8","anchor-1-9","anchor-1-10"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-006","seg-007","seg-009","seg-011","seg-014","seg-018"]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0005-1:part-1","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/070-tu-yuan/fangyurun-yuanshi/0005-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"標韻","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵","excerpt":"方玉润标出《兔爰》三章用韵：首章“羅、爲、罹、吪”入歌部，","fullText":"方玉润标出《兔爰》三章用韵：首章“羅、爲、罹、吪”入歌部，次章“罦、憂”为尤部而“造、覺”另转效部叶韵，末章“罿、庸、凶、聰”归东部。其标韵显示此诗随章换部，而每章句末皆以重叠收煞。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0005-1:part-2","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/070-tu-yuan/fangyurun-yuanshi/0005-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"標韻","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵","excerpt":"次章“罦、憂”为尤部而“造、覺”另转效部叶韵，","fullText":"方玉润标出《兔爰》三章用韵：首章“羅、爲、罹、吪”入歌部，次章“罦、憂”为尤部而“造、覺”另转效部叶韵，末章“罿、庸、凶、聰”归东部。其标韵显示此诗随章换部，而每章句末皆以重叠收煞。","notes":null,"partOrder":2,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0005-1:part-3","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/070-tu-yuan/fangyurun-yuanshi/0005-1","materialI